Note that Glamour of Kintaz interacts strangely with every other spell. It lands, but does not extend the mez duration, and also breaks mez when it wears off itself. The memblur component, however, seems to take effect as normal.
This behavior has been reported as a bug here: [https://www.project1999.com/forums/showthread.php?t=301767].

